  INITIAL "0"
  LABEL "Interest Portion"
  POSITION 12
  MAX-WIDTH 17
  COLUMN-LABEL "Interest Portion"
  DECIMALS 2
  ORDER 110
  MANDATORY

ADD FIELD "LateFee" OF "LoanPayment" AS decimal
